Contributing
============

ASON was created by Hemashushu <hippospark@gmail.com>, who holds its
copyright. It is distributed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0 with
additional terms (see the LICENSE and LICENSE.additional files), and the
author promises that it will always remain free to use.

Contributions from the community are welcome. By submitting a contribution
(such as code, documentation, or a patch, e.g., via a pull request), you
confirm that:

(a) The contribution is your own original work, or you otherwise have the
    right to submit it. Any third-party material in it must be clearly
    marked with its source and license.
(b) You understand and agree that this project is open source, that your
    contribution will be distributed as part of the project under the same
    license, and that you transfer the copyright of your own work in the
    contribution to the author of the project.

To credit your work, you may add your name below the copyright notice in
the header of each source file you contribute to, in the following format:

Contributor: John Smith <name@email_domain>

-------------------------------------------------------------------------

参与贡献
=======

ASON 由河马蜀黍 <hippospark@gmail.com> 创建并享有版权。本项目采用 Mozilla Public License 2.0
及附加条款（见 LICENSE 和 LICENSE.additional 文件）授权分发，作者承诺本项目将始终可以免费使用。

欢迎来自社区的贡献。当你提交贡献（如代码、文档或补丁，例如通过 Pull Request 提交）时，
即表示你确认：

(a) 所贡献的内容是你的原创作品，或你有权提交该内容。其中如包含第三方内容，
    必须清楚注明其来源和授权协议；
(b) 你明白并同意本项目是开源的，你贡献的内容将作为本项目的一部分、以相同的协议分发，
    并且你将所贡献内容中属于你的那部分版权转让给本项目的作者。

为了记录你的贡献，你可以在所修改的源代码文件头部的版权声明下方署名，格式如下：

贡献者：张三 <名字@邮箱域名>
